@gene('s3', 'distance field to the goals or to my spawn while healing (cached static spawn field when no enemies seen); when healing or carrying 20+ gems, route around a 2-tile buffer of visible enemy champions, falling back to avoiding only their tiles, then to the plain field')
def goal_field() -> Field:
